---
title: 3-Envelope Beef Roast
cookTime: 8 hours
tags: ["Beef", "Slow Cooker"]
---

Mix @water{2%cups} with all 3 envelopes of dry mixes: @dry italian salad dressing mix{1%packet}, @dry ranch salad dressing mix{1%packet}, @dry brown gravy mix{1%packet}.

Add the @Beef Roast{3%lb} to the crock pot. Pour the water mix over the roast.

Cook on low for ~{8%hours} (or on high for 4 hours).
